<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine bankers call meeting of treasurers.</title>
<headline>Philippine bankers call meeting of treasurers.</headline>
<text>
<p>MANILA, July 14 (Reuter) The Bankers Association of the Philippines (BAP) on Monday called a meeting of its member bank treasurers at 6 pm (1000 gmt) this evening.</p>
<p>The meeting will be at the BAP office.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841 8914</p>
</text>
